- backdrop: clear glass only while Immersive is up; main UI falls back to Mica
- Blueprint: no grid, crosses or cover wash under glass; panels keep a dark box
- Coverflow: no blurred-cover backdrop under glass; corner keys hidden
- Lyrics: soft dark shade behind the column
- settings: drop the cover-glow slider
- coverFlight: flyIntoLyrics swaps the scene first, then runs flight, fade-out and fade-in together

